{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:b3813a94e47f0bdf","name":"Liquid Cable Dispenser","source":{"id":"source:reference-b3813a94e47f0bdf","title":"Liquid Cable Dispenser","revision":18339,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:59:02Z","sha256":"347953a3c44d6551f819d0c54769ca0145b01bea57882fcb6740657dfb078681","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18339","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Liquid%20Cable%20Dispenser&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-b3813a94e47f0bdf","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 10\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Liquid Cable Dispensers contain a special liquid that instantly solidifies upon contact with either atmosphere or vacuum to form a tough, lightweight, flexible cable. The dispenser contains enough liquid for 15 meters (10 squares) of cable, and is refillable at authorized outlets. The cable has a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," score of 28, can safely support up to 560 kg, and it can be broken with a DC 24 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," check.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
